#### 1. Swing's Modified MVC Architecture (Model-Delegate):
Swing combines the View and Controller into a single object called the **UI Delegate** (managed by `javax.swing.plaf.ComponentUI`). This allows the visual skin (look) and event handling (feel) to be swapped dynamically at runtime without modifying the underlying data model.

```
